    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/14c62340c98d8bfb10bf26196d15c481.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The essence of emptiness is a part of the human soul that grows as it commits cruel sinful acts. With an empty soul, a person loses their humanity, revealing their inner stench. Requests that previously seemed alien to morality become his own desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responding to the call of the void is the easiest way to lose your humanity and your own appearance along with your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/6207625ffb0c35627d35ccbf720c2275.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.poster.avif?t=1747678581\" width=626 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.webm?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.mp4?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drawn Tale is a creepy adventure set in a 3D world with hand-drawn graphics. The story follows the trials of a boy named Mor who finds himself in a mysterious place called &quot;Purgatory.&quot; There, he will encounter dangerous monsters, cruel creatures, and his own demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll find puzzles, drama, atmospheric music, dark humor, and a fair amount of cruelty, all set against the backdrop of beautiful hand-drawn visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/6207625ffb0c35627d35ccbf720c2275.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.poster.avif?t=1747678581\" width=626 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.webm?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.mp4?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large amount of creepypasta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice hand-drawn visual style in 3D space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story and detailed world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and dramatic atmosphere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of violent scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of black humor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and well-designed characters!<br>  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/14c62340c98d8bfb10bf26196d15c481.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The essence of emptiness is a part of the human soul that grows as it commits cruel sinful acts. With an empty soul, a person loses their humanity, revealing their inner stench. Requests that previously seemed alien to morality become his own desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responding to the call of the void is the easiest way to lose your humanity and your own appearance along with your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/6207625ffb0c35627d35ccbf720c2275.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.poster.avif?t=1747678581\" width=626 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.webm?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/220ce28345e56937186e37ecf3b47be9.mp4?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drawn Tale is a creepy adventure set in a 3D world with hand-drawn graphics. The story follows the trials of a boy named Mor who finds himself in a mysterious place called &quot;Purgatory.&quot; There, he will encounter dangerous monsters, cruel creatures, and his own demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll find puzzles, drama, atmospheric music, dark humor, and a fair amount of cruelty, all set against the backdrop of beautiful hand-drawn visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/6207625ffb0c35627d35ccbf720c2275.webp?t=1747678581\" width=615 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.poster.avif?t=1747678581\" width=626 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.webm?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820770/extras/732202426d6d1d81bbbaf53e648b26dd.mp4?t=1747678581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large amount of creepypasta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice hand-drawn visual style in 3D space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story and detailed world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and dramatic atmosphere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of violent scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of black humor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and well-designed characters!<br>  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "After taking a life, a boy is killed and awakens in a twisted, nightmarish Purgatory. Explore a world of horror, solve eerie puzzles, evade lurking monsters, and fight to keep your soul intact before it\u2019s devoured by the Void.",
